{"about_the_game":"The universe of Astra: Fading Stars is all brought to life by traditional, 2D, hand drawn animations and surroundings that compose the atmospheric look of the game.<br><br>Engage in this action adventure with classic gameplay, daunting enemies and ancient riddles. Explore multilayered secrets, discover hidden truths and gradually reveal the mechanics and the lore of this world. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666480/extras/d10d4346a87c624b364e9da5b6a16f13.avif?t=1756561036\" width=630 height=232 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666480/extras/6e955a7b0d8658cb568654a80a96397c.webp?t=1756561036\" width=630 height=57 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Astra Call, an ability springing from your soul. Utilize it to interact with the environment on a variety of situations that come across you.<br></li><li> Highly responsive controls that permit flow and precision. <br></li><li> Traditionally animated characters and world.<br></li><li> Clues are scattered around the world. Connect them to unravel the truth. <br></li><li> Collect Astra and use it to upgrade your strength. <br></li><li> Meet a variety of species, hostile or not, that react according to your actions. <br></li><li> Numerous otherworldly enemies block your path. Among them, dangerous bosses and mini bosses. <br></li><li> Multiple scores of original, instrumental music.<br></li><li> World randomization, gameplay elements can change on every run.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666480/extras/c129b6675b7565e4f4a09378d9098abb.avif?t=1756561036\" width=630 height=232 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666480/extras/9777f2ee4567df950a54e05e79754a4e.avif?t=1756561036\" width=630 height=232 /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666480/extras/6e955a7b0d8658cb568654a80a96397c.webp?t=1756561036\" width=630 height=57 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A rich story unfolds</h2>The past haunts the future. Two opposing forces compete, will your astral soul be strong enough to fight the corruption?<br><br><br><i>The stars are slowly fading<br>      one less each time       <br>         not long until     <br>         they're gone<br>            forever</i>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1666480?t=1756561036","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756561036","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666480/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756561036","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666480/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756561036","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1666490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"The universe of Astra: Fading Stars is all brought to life by traditional, 2D, hand drawn animations and surroundings that compose the atmospheric look of the game.<br><br>Engage in this action adventure with classic gameplay, daunting enemies and ancient riddles. Explore multilayered secrets, discover hidden truths and gradually reveal the mechanics and the lore of this world. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st